1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,884
Behind WenQuest courses are nine textbooks of our own: robotics,

2
00:00:03,904 --> 00:00:06,117
mechanical design, manufacturing, PLC, AI,

3
00:00:06,137 --> 00:00:08,191
and the maths and physics beneath them.

4
00:00:09,211 --> 00:00:12,672
Each chapter opens with its animations and virtual labs, one click away,

5
00:00:13,142 --> 00:00:16,439
and switches between Chinese and English in one click.

6
00:00:17,459 --> 00:00:22,066
Each section starts from a real problem, then the concept, an animation, a lab,

7
00:00:22,086 --> 00:00:25,171
and a model to solve, mostly with robots as examples.

8
00:00:25,641 --> 00:00:30,020
Every worked example has actually been run; the numbers come from the code.

9
00:00:31,040 --> 00:00:35,954
In the labs you drag a parameter and watch the matrices and coordinates change,

10
00:00:35,974 --> 00:00:38,015
each lab with a robotics problem,

11
00:00:38,485 --> 00:00:40,857
plus a lab guide and a report template.

12
00:00:41,877 --> 00:00:46,311
All slides are interactive web pages. You page through them like PowerPoint,

13
00:00:46,781 --> 00:00:50,872
with animations, labs and 3D models built in, to work with live in class.

14
00:00:51,892 --> 00:00:53,917
The books are on the web and as PDF,

15
00:00:53,937 --> 00:00:57,098
ready to read once you sign up on the learning platform.
